==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|careless|ly}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# Giving the appearance of [[carelessness]]; [[relaxedly]].
#: ''The papers were '''carelessly''' strewn on the table.''
# Done without care or attention; [[inattentively]].
#: ''Distracted by the salesperson, he '''carelessly''' read the contract.''

